  {
   "id": "wood100_tapered_curved_radial_stress",
   "title": "矩形變斷面彎曲構材之最大半徑方向應力（木構造 5.4.9 (5.34)(5.35)式）",
   "src": "wood100",
   "clause": "5.4.9",
   "page": 72,
   "keywords": "木構造 變斷面局部彎曲構材 半徑方向應力 係數kρ (5.34) (5.35)",
   "unit": "kgf/cm2",
   "output": "sigma_R",
   "latex": "\\sigma_R = k_\\rho \\frac{6M}{bh^2},\\qquad k_\\rho = A + B\\left(\\frac{h}{\\rho_m}\\right) + C\\left(\\frac{h}{\\rho_m}\\right)^2",
   "vars": {
    "M": {
     "desc": "設計彎矩 M",
     "unit": "kgf-cm",
     "min": 0
    },
    "b": {
     "desc": "構材寬度 b",
     "unit": "cm",
     "min": 0.1
    },
    "h": {
     "desc": "中央斷面深 h",
     "unit": "cm",
     "min": 0.1
    },
    "rho_m": {
     "desc": "彎曲部分中央之曲率半徑 ρ_m",
     "unit": "cm",
     "min": 0.1
    },
    "theta_deg": {
     "desc": "彎曲構材與水平夾角 θ（0°~30°，依表5.4-7 內插 A, B, C）",
     "unit": "度",
     "min": 0,
     "max": 30
    }
   },
   "defs": [
    [
     "A",
     "interp(theta_deg, [0.0, 2.5, 5.0, 7.5, 10.0, 15.0, 20.0, 25.0, 30.0], [0.0, 0.0079, 0.0174, 0.0279, 0.0391, 0.0629, 0.0893, 0.1214, 0.1649])"
    ],
    [
     "B",
     "interp(theta_deg, [0.0, 2.5, 5.0, 7.5, 10.0, 15.0, 20.0, 25.0, 30.0], [0.25, 0.1747, 0.1251, 0.0937, 0.0754, 0.0619, 0.0608, 0.0605, 0.0603])"
    ],
    [
     "C",
     "interp(theta_deg, [0.0, 2.5, 5.0, 7.5, 10.0, 15.0, 20.0, 25.0, 30.0], [0.0, 0.1284, 0.1939, 0.2162, 0.2119, 0.1722, 0.1393, 0.1238, 0.1115])"
    ],
    [
     "k_rho",
     "A + B * (h / rho_m) + C * ((h / rho_m) ** 2)"
    ]
   ],
   "expr": "k_rho * 6.0 * M / (b * (h ** 2))",
   "conditions": [
    {
     "expr": "M >= 0 and b > 0 and h > 0 and rho_m > 0 and 0 <= theta_deg <= 30",
     "msg": "M >= 0、b,h,ρm > 0 且 0° <= θ <= 30°"
    }
   ],
   "tests": [
    {
     "in": {
      "M": 500000,
      "b": 15,
      "h": 60,
      "rho_m": 400,
      "theta_deg": 0
     },
     "out": 2.0833333333333335
    },
    {
     "in": {
      "M": 500000,
      "b": 15,
      "h": 60,
      "rho_m": 400,
      "theta_deg": 10
     },
     "out": 3.065430555555556
    }
   ],
   "notes": "木構造 5.4.9(3) (5.34)(5.35)式及表5.4-7（p.72-73）。特別注意：p.72 原文 (5.34) 式分母將 h^2 漏印平方作 bh（見 θ=0° 時 k_ρ = 0.25*(h/ρm)，代入 6M/(bh^2) 方能還原 (5.33) 式 3M/(2ρbh)）；本驗證式依力學因次與 (5.33) 致性採用 6M/(b*h^2) 並於備註明載原文漏印平方。",
   "status": "verified",
   "verified": {
    "method": "逐字對照 wood100 PDF p.72-73 §5.4.9(3) 與表5.4-7（p72.png/p73.png）",
    "by": "agent",
    "date": "2026-11-14"
   },
   "_file": "wood100_p2_members.json"
  },
